  "description": "`HiBoP` is an interactive application for visualizing human intracranial brain data, including iEEG, CCEP, fMRI, electrodes, anatomical MRI, and 3D brain meshes. It is designed for researchers who need to explore multimodal brain recordings in an intuitive 3D environment, linking signals, anatomy, and electrode localizations in a consistent and visual way.",
